<tr><td>Vite</td><td>5.x</td><td>Lightning-fast build tool and development server</td></tr>
<tr><td>React Router DOM</td><td>6.x</td><td>Client-side routing and page navigation</td></tr>
<tr><td>Axios</td><td>Latest</td><td>HTTP client for REST API communication</td></tr>
