</table>
<h3>3.3 AI / ML Inference Service Technologies</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Technology</th><th>Version</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
<tr><td>Python</td><td>3.10+</td><td>Primary language for the AI microservice</td></tr>
<tr><td>FastAPI</td><td>0.110+</td><td>High-performance async web framework for the inference API</td></tr>
<tr><td>Uvicorn</td><td>0.28+</td><td>ASGI server for running the FastAPI application</td></tr>
