<tr><td>PyTorch (optional)</td><td>2.2+</td><td>Deep learning backbone for CLAM / TransMIL / AB-MIL models</td></tr>
<tr><td>Torchvision (optional)</td><td>0.17+</td><td>Image transforms and pretrained feature extractors</td></tr>
